    text: "Affected stops:\r\nColorado Blvd & Montview Blvd (#13137) (eastbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & 23rd Ave (#13058) (eastbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Birch St (#10569) (eastbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Dexter St (#10574) (eastbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Birch St (#10570) (westbound)\r\n23rd Ave & Albion St (#10568) (westbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & 23rd Ave (#13057) (westbound)\r\nColorado Blvd & Montview Blvd (#13138) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 20 get on/off buses at:\r\nColorado Blvd & 17th Ave (#13053)\r\n23rd Ave & Elm St (#10576)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 20 get on/off buses at:\r\n23rd Ave & Dexter St (#10575)\r\nColorado Blvd & 17th Ave (#13054)"
